  "body": "tmuxp 1.78.0 updates libtmux to 0.64.0, a fixes-only release. It has no breaking changes.\n\n## Highlights\n\n### libtmux 0.64.0\n\ntmuxp now requires libtmux `~=0.64.0` (was `~=0.63.0`). [libtmux 0.64.0](https://github.com/tmux-python/libtmux/releases/tag/v0.64.0) makes commands act on the session, window or pane they were called on, passes values that start with `-` or end in `;` to tmux as data, and keeps a newline in a pane's path from breaking listings.\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* libtmux 0.64.0 by @tony in https://github.com/tmux-python/tmuxp/pull/1106\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/tmux-python/tmuxp/compare/v1.77.0...v1.78.0",
